   "text": "NABA - Nuova Accademia di Belle Arti Milano - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nNABA - Nuova Accademia di Belle Arti Milano\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFounded in 1980, NABA, Nuova Accademia di Belle Arti, with campus in Milan and in Rome, is the largest private art academy in Italy. Since 1981 NABA is legally recognised by the Higher Education in Art and Music system (AFAM, Alta Formazione Artistica e Musicale), regulated by the Ministry of University and Research (MUR).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n22/07/2026 08:23\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n18/11/2025 07:18\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nItaly\nYearly Fees\nMax: €19,980.00\nMin: €18,181.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n35%\n1,050 of 3,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1980\nCampus(es)\nMilan, Rome\nCountry\nItaly\nExcluded Countries\nEgypt, Israel, Nigeria, Portugal, Romania, South Africa, Spain, Zambia, Zimbabwe, Kenya\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/07/2026\nContract End Date\n30/06/2027\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5OQiUFBjpfE\nInternship Details\nInternship available\nAdditional Information\n-",
